#: ../doc/main_window.rst:253
msgid ""
"The OpenShot main window is composed of multiple **docks**. These **docks** "
"are arranged and snapped together into a grouping that we call a **View**. "
"OpenShot includes :guilabel:`Simple View`, :guilabel:`Color View`, and "
":guilabel:`My Views` (user-defined layouts)."
